  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>超級 RPG 字型</strong></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">描述</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">這款現代且獨特的流暢風格字型易於閱讀，將進一步提升您的原版體驗。專為 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 模組包設計，但現在對公眾開放使用！<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">基於 Jovanny Lemonad 製作的熱門 Google 字型 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Russo One\" rel=\"nofollow\">Russo One</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">此字型採用開放字型授權條款。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/634/russo-one-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\"><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>截圖（來自 DarkRPG）</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/413/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/414/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/412/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/415/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器，與朋友一起遊玩！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享有 25% 折扣！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
